    "technique_claimed": "T1562.002",
    "rationale": "payload.exe (PID 3068, from pedro's Downloads, run by pedro-admin) connects to 192.168.56.40:8443 and opened and started cmd.exe, which ran reg add ...\\Policies\\System\\Audit /v ProcessCreationIncludeCmdLine_Enabled /d 0 /f; the value is now 0, so new process events lose their command lines. Isolate pedro-computer."
  },
